    "done_when": "Promotion consults reckon/crew/standing_suite.py:hold_reason. When a run's review tier is none or light and hold_reason returns a sentence for the owning project, reckon crew complete refuses, naming that sentence and the two ways out: record a passing suite run, or record a lead waiver with standing_suite.record_waiver. A full-tier promotion is never held by it. The check is made where promotion already resolves the tier, near reckon/crew/promotion.py:_require_review_waiver. It reads the project root and name promotion already has, and it neither copies nor re-derives the tier.\n\nTwo commands in reckon/cli.py:\n- reckon crew suite run --project NAME runs the project's declared suite through standing_suite.run under its budget and records the result with standing_suite.record, printing the recorded counts as JSON.\n- reckon crew suite waive --project NAME --reason TEXT records a waiver.\n\ntests/test_standing_suite_holds_promotion.py synthesises a project under tmp_path whose declared suite fails at collection, then records a run. It drives the promotion path the other promotion tests use and asserts:\n- a tier-none promotion is refused with the hold sentence;\n- a full-tier promotion is not held;\n- after a later passing run, or a recorded waiver, the tier-none promotion proceeds.\nIt reads and writes nothing outside tmp_path. That file, tests/test_standing_suite.py and the existing promotion test files keep their base failing ids and add none. For promotion.py, the population is the full tests/ directory, run with -n 8; its FAILED ids are compared with base in the same environment and none are added.\n\nThe manifest writes baseline_suite and after_suite each as one line of armed JSON: revision, command with no placeholder, exit_status, completed, failure_count, failure_ids, log_path. Every gate log opens with one line naming its revision, tree and command. The declared negative control is applied and observed to fail, and its log's absolute path is in the manifest with an EXIT= line and the FAILED id.",
    "estimated_hours": null,
    "goal": "Make promotion hold tier none and light promotions while the project's declared suite last failed to collect or overran its budget, and give the coordinator commands to run and record the suite and to waive the hold",
